      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> The task requires the creation of multiple Python files for a text-to-speech (TTS) service integration using Google's Text-to-Speech API. I need to generate the following files:\n1. synthesize_text.py\n2. synthesize_ssml.py\n3. select_voice.py\n4. save_audio.py\n5. speech_client.py\n6. speech_models.py\n7. script_translate.py\n8. script_safety.py\n9. script_embedding.py\n10. tts_qa_transcript.py\n\nEach scored implementation file must use a concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code. The local helper files may contain configuration loading, payload normalization, or response parsing utilities when useful. </thinking>\n\n",
